Package: amar-bangla-kotha
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Amar Bangla Kotha Team <support@amar-bangla-kotha.org>
Depends: libc6, python3, python3-gi, ibus (>= 1.5.0)
Description: Production Bangla phonetic keyboard for Linux (IBus/Fcitx5)
 Amar Bangla Kotha (আমার বাংলা কথা) is a high-performance, privacy-first
 phonetic Bengali input method engine built in modern C++.
 It features Avro-compatible phonetic transliteration, next-word
 prediction, personal shortcuts, and auto-bypass for password fields.
